;
; coding information
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
C00,Parking Brake (J540) Coding
C01,0000011 - Parking Brake without Auto-Hold (Rest of World / PR-UH1)
C02,0000012 - Parking Brake with Auto-Hold (Rest of World / PR-UH2)
C03,0000013 - Parking Brake with Auto-Hold (USA) "UNDOCUMENTED"
