; 2442 - Electric Park/Handbrake Indicator Lamp (K213)
; 2573 - Rear Left Parking Brake Motor (V282)
; 2575 - Rear Right Parking Brake Motor (V283)
; 2576 - Open Rear Parking Brake Motors (V282 & V283)
; 2578 - Close Rear Parking Brake Motors (V282 & V283)
; 2844 - Auto Hold Indicator Lamp 1 (K237) and 2 (K238)
